# Stadium Tidalmage: "Whenever this creature enters or attacks, you may draw a card. If you do, discard a card." Bot1 casts it on turn 1
# (Black Lotus and Mox Ruby pay {2}{U}{R}); accepting the enter trigger draws Ancestral Recall and discards the chosen Island. On turn 3
# the attack trigger is accepted too: Bot1 draws an Island (after the turn-3 draw) and discards the chosen Mox Pearl. The attack deals 4 to Bot2.

